Accreditation

Positive assessment of Polish Accreditation Committee regarding the quality of education on the Architecture and Civil Engineering fields of study. Committee has evaluated with distinction the cooperation with the socioeconomic environment of these fields of study. In the assessment were also mentioned such elements as:

* the convergence of curricula of all fields and levels of studies are consistent with the graduate profile declared in the Faculty strategy;
* mechanisms enhancing the quality of education on the basis of quality development of the teaching staff and development of infrastructure and cooperation with external stakeholders;
* high quality of education, versatility of educational offer, innovative forms and methods of teaching, adequate infrastructure, maintaining high qualifications of the faculty staff;
* A well-developed quality assurance system;
* positive feedback from students about classrooms, workshops and labs.

